-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> (equality-mod-null relation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb A\">\\(\\mathbb A\\)</span> (measure algebra, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"40617012e3a2a78d\" href=\"?note=40617012e3a2a78d\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-measure11-measure-algebra.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-measure11-measure-algebra.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathbb A\">\\(a\\in\\mathbb A\\)</span> (candidate atom)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11MeasureAlgebra}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6Atom}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11MeasureAlgebra}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6Atom}_S\\)</span> (upstream predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4AtomOfMeasureAlgebra}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4AtomOfMeasureAlgebra}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure4\\text{-}atom\\text{-}of\\text{-}measure\\text{-}algebra} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4AtomOfMeasureAlgebra}_S(\\mathbb A,a,X,\\Sigma,\\mu,E)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11MeasureAlgebra}_S(\\mathbb A,\\Sigma,\\mu,E)\\land\\exists A\\in\\Sigma\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6Atom}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu,A)\\land a=\\{B\\in\\Sigma:\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in E\\}\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure4\\text{-}atom\\text{-}of\\text{-}measure\\text{-}algebra} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4AtomOfMeasureAlgebra}_S(\\mathbb A,a,X,\\Sigma,\\mu,E)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11MeasureAlgebra}_S(\\mathbb A,\\Sigma,\\mu,E)\\land\\exists A\\in\\Sigma\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6Atom}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu,A)\\land a=\\{B\\in\\Sigma:\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in E\\}\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></